																		Milestones; or the work formerly called &quot;History Itself&quot;
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-reach" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1779895); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1779895&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606834532" alt="Dr Reach" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1779895)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-reach" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1779895); return false;" >Dr Reach</a></span> <span class="odate time_1533032325 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">31 Jul 2018 10:18</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3892388">
									

<p>I'm <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">terrified</span> proud to present the product of <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">literal hundreds of</span> hours of <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">desperation</span> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">inadequacy</span> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">deep, deep obsession</span> work: an SCP-4000 entry mostly composed of a single dialog between two original characters and crosslinking.</p>
<p>&quot;Wow, Reach, you're just priming yourself for insta-failure there!&quot;</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">WELL&nbsp;WHAT&nbsp;CAN&nbsp;I&nbsp;SAY&nbsp;I'M&nbsp;OPTIMISTIC.</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">i'm&nbsp;sorry&nbsp;I&nbsp;shouted</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Thanks to the SCP-ES staff for putting up with my absences (particularly <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/morhadow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3535580); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3535580&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1533038948" alt="morhadow" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3535580)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/morhadow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3535580); return false;">morhadow</a></span>, whose patience and good wishes are worth far more than he may realize); you guys are the best. Also, big hugs for <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/metaphysician" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1698079); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1698079&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1533038948" alt="Metaphysician" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1698079)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/metaphysician" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1698079); return false;">Metaphysician</a></span>, whose contributions to the site give it a flavour that goes from sickly sweet to nightmare salty&#8230; and I can never have enough of it. &lt;3</p>
<p>Thanks to the authors of SCP-1000, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thedeadlymoose" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(732274); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=732274&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1533038948" alt="thedeadlymoose" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=732274)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thedeadlymoose" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(732274); return false;">thedeadlymoose</a></span>, SCP-2000, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fortunefavorsbold" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1552358); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1552358&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1533038948" alt="FortuneFavorsBold" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1552358)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fortunefavorsbold" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1552358); return false;">FortuneFavorsBold</a></span> and SCP-3000, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1888434); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1888434&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1533038948" alt="djkaktus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1888434)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1888434); return false;">djkaktus</a></span>; all-encompassing proposals that did not only rock, but set in stone our evolution as a community and the tone for many other great things still to come.</p>
<p>May we remember their wonderful concepts and exquisite executions for all time; theirs are contributions that made me grow, as they made this idea grow. This may be a grossly insufficient tribute, but I will be happy to just bring back a piece of what they inspired.</p>
<hr />
<p>Now, also important:</p>
<p>I believe I obtained image <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/4000contestdrreach/SCP40001">SCP-4000-2</a>] from <a href="https://www.free-photo.cc/galleries/woman/old-woman-in-desert-with-wrinkles-in-face-8768">here, a stock image site</a>; I modified it afterwards with <a href="https://www.gimp.org/">GIMP.</a></p>
<p>Image <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/4000contestdrreach/SCP40002">SCP-4000-2</a> comes from <a href="https://pixabay.com/es/rocas-arena-playa-piedra-937329/">comes from this stock photo site</a>.</p>
<p>Images <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/4000contestdrreach/errorinfo">errorinfo</a>, <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/4000contestdrreach/MEMEBOT">MEMEBOT</a> and <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/4000contestdrreach/SCP4000">SCP-4000</a> were made by me via a number of image manipulation programs. They kinda are posted under CC by default, I think?</p>
<hr /></div>
</div>
</div>
<p>Hope you enjoy it! As always, comments and criticisms will be appreciated. :3</p>

