<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;This&nbsp;is&nbsp;totally&nbsp;my&nbsp;jam.</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;And&nbsp;this&nbsp;post&nbsp;is&nbsp;probably&nbsp;too&nbsp;long</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>I get the sense that emotional communication is near impossible in SCP-4000 because you're actually conveying the precise way you feel, which is inherently not understandable by another person.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>&quot;Ripe&quot; SCP-4000-2 cases may only be handled by D-Class subjects while placed inside Black Box facilities to prevent or mitigate potentially contagious memetic, cognitive or info-hazardous breakouts. SCP-4000-2 cases not contained by MTF Alpha-1 Coherence Units dispatched to retrieve them will be handled as Safe items and stored in Standard Secure Lockers, as their dimensions require.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I'm not sure if I mean this as a criticism, but hardly any of this makes sense.</p>
<p>The watermark on -1's file is obscuring the text. Also, I'm not sure how I feel about the particulars of that file, though that would be more pertinent if she were the focal anomaly here.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Personnel instructed to not look at 2-51.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>This should be -52.</p>
<p>Boy, that's an awful lot of addenda that I just have no idea what the purpose of was. c.c</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Dr. Calibax continues to walk towards SCP-4000</p>
</blockquote>
<p>That should be -1. There are a couple other instances of this.</p>
<p>Why is she talking in all caps? &#8230;Okay, that's supposed to be SCP-4000. I think you could do something else to better show them switching languages.</p>
<p>&#8230;I am reading this, and absorbing none of it. I have no idea what's going on. It's just a huge lore dump with nothing to hang it on.</p>
<p>With the continual reference to the other X000s, I feel like this could be a winner, but I'm mostly just bewildered.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>Probably a hearty upvote after the contest.</p>

